    m_LineSpacing: 1
  m_Text: 'Put out the virtual fire with the PASS method.


    P - PULL the safety
    pin (press PULL PIN)


    A - AIM at the BASE of the fire from 1 to 3 metres
    away


    S - SQUEEZE and hold the SQUEEZE button


    S - SWEEP side to side
    until all three flames are out


    Each mistake costs 10 points.'
